Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.83,0:22:37.34,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_ED JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}信じている
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.21,0:22:45.50,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_ED JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}未来だけが
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.11,0:22:53.77,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_ED JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}一つの答えなのか
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.77,0:22:59.27,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_ED JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}誰も知らない
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.27,0:23:06.16,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_ED JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}記憶だけは
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.43,0:23:14.00,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_ED JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}真実を
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.73,0:23:25.12,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_ED JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}写し出そうとその胸を
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.87,0:23:29.38,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_ED JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}叩くの
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.97,0:23:36.83,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_ED JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}忘れないように
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.10,0:23:44.94,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_ED JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}星の数ほどもある
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.98,0:23:53.94,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_ED JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}思い出の螺旋を越えた先
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.94,0:24:00.99,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_ED JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}光り輝く中に
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.47,0:24:06.36,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_ED JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}見えるものがあるでしょ
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.63,0:24:13.54,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_ED JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}記憶の光
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.54,0:24:15.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.83,0:22:37.34,方正小标宋_GBK_ED CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}唯有未来
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.21,0:22:45.50,方正小标宋_GBK_ED CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我始终相信
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.11,0:22:53.77,方正小标宋_GBK_ED CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这是一种回应吗
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.77,0:22:59.27,方正小标宋_GBK_ED CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}无人知晓
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.27,0:23:06.16,方正小标宋_GBK_ED CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}唯有记忆
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.43,0:23:14.00,方正小标宋_GBK_ED CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}谱写出的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.73,0:23:25.12,方正小标宋_GBK_ED CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}真实啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.87,0:23:29.38,方正小标宋_GBK_ED CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}激荡我心
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.97,0:23:36.83,方正小标宋_GBK_ED CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}只为铭记于心
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.10,0:23:44.94,方正小标宋_GBK_ED CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}记忆如繁星般浩瀚
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.98,0:23:53.94,方正小标宋_GBK_ED CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}组成漫长的螺旋线
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.94,0:24:00.99,方正小标宋_GBK_ED CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}螺旋彼方
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.47,0:24:06.36,方正小标宋_GBK_ED CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}光辉灿烂
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.63,0:24:13.54,方正小标宋_GBK_ED CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那是记忆之光
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.99,0:01:59.14,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,本艦は間もなくゲシュタムの門を通過
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.99,0:01:59.14,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.89,0:02:02.61,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,バラン到着予定時刻タム0730
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.02,0:02:07.92,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,ドメルがUX-01を呼び寄せていたのは　好都合でしたね
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.83,0:02:04.21,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_BackG JP,NTP,0,0,0,,システム衛星にリンク　
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.83,0:02:05.70,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_BackG JP,NTP,0,0,0,,接続完備
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.33,0:02:10.84,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,猟犬が投げた網に獲物がかかったら
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.22,0:02:13.95,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,アクエリアスの遺跡であれを行います
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.90,0:02:16.55,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,よくてね　ミレーネル
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.90,0:02:16.55,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.91,0:02:17.94,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,ザーベルク
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.57,0:02:20.23,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.80,0:02:21.11,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.58,0:02:21.90,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.55,0:02:22.80,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.41,0:02:23.71,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.30,0:02:24.59,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.51,0:02:25.84,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.32,0:02:34.99,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,最後の一本　散布終了っと
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.41,0:02:37.40,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,まったく　なんっすか　ありゃ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.85,0:02:38.66,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,さあな
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.05,0:02:42.05,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,さあなって　補給を受けたかと思ったら
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.31,0:02:44.83,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,こんな中身もわかーねえもんをばらまけって お前　　
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.97,0:02:46.50,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,俺達は便利屋じゃねえ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.58,0:02:48.02,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,戦争屋だつーの
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.45,0:02:49.06,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,ったく
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.49,0:02:50.79,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,そう腐るな
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.89,0:02:55.73,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,次の任務はデスラー総統直々の特命だ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.37,0:02:59.08,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,えっ　じゃ「ヤマト」の野郎は
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.82,0:03:02.56,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,俺達はドメル将軍の指揮を離れるんで
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.26,0:03:08.47,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,ああ　「ヤマト」の始末はあの女狐が自分でやるらしい
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.95,0:03:24.46,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,亜空間ソナーに感なし
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.39,0:03:27.45,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,次元境界面に漣は立ってない
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.58,0:03:31.72,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,「ヤマト」進路上に　例の船は潜んでないみたいだな
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.56,0:03:34.09,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,ええ
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.23,0:03:37.28,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,銀河系か
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.07,0:03:42.07,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,ああ　あの光の洪水の中に俺達の地球がある
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.95,0:03:46.72,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,そして　目指すイスカンダルは大マゼラン銀河の中だ
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.01,0:03:49.09,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,まだまだ遠いな
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.41,0:03:52.37,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,ねえ　古代君
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.79,0:03:53.24,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,なに
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.11,0:03:55.07,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,いい機会だし
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.05,0:03:57.93,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,操縦　交代しない
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.31,0:03:58.78,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,駄目
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.01,0:04:02.30,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,哨戒任務も終わったし　いいじゃない
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.75,0:04:04.70,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,大事な機体を失いたくない
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.51,0:04:07.23,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,それ　どういう意味
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.31,0:04:08.79,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,いや　そのまんまだけど
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.13,0:04:13.09,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,古代一尉　船務長命令　操縦を交代しなさい
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.18,0:04:14.03,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_BackG JP,NTP,0,0,0,,若いもんはええのう
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.22,0:04:15.48,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,戦術長権限でお断りします
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.74,0:04:19.53,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,貴方　この前の一件で戦術長権限停止中でしょう
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.39,0:04:21.57,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,それ言っちゃうわけ
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.10,0:04:22.55,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_BackG JP,NTP,0,0,0,,何なんだよ　これ
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.33,0:04:23.18,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,言っちゃいます
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.52,0:04:25.87,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,003　こちら「ヤマト」
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.56,0:04:29.23,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,言いにくいんですが　通音が筒抜けです
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.52,0:04:33.55,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,副長は何であの二人を選抜されたんですか
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.51,0:04:38.69,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,試作した亜空間ソナーは電探に精通している森一尉が適任
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.95,0:04:42.87,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,戦術長権限を凍結されて暇そうな古代一尉は運転手
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.21,0:04:44.19,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,合理的でしょう
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.10,0:04:49.62,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,雪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.09,0:04:52.80,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,何なの
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.61,0:05:04.24,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,何だこれ　歌
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.94,0:05:06.35,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,歌だ　歌が聞こ
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.22,0:05:08.18,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,どうした　相原
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.50,0:05:09.54,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,「ヤマト」　応答せよ
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.59,0:05:10.18,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,「ヤマト」
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.18,0:05:12.18,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.43,0:05:16.40,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,ちょっ　森君　
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.61,0:05:17.33,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,帰投します
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.48,0:05:21.55,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,おい　あれ
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.09,0:05:40.12,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,どうなってるんだ
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.45,0:05:42.97,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,格納庫にアクセスできない
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.58,0:05:44.89,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,操縦　返してもらうよ
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.94,0:06:01.52,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,シド　このまま回転と同期を維持
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.96,0:06:02.86,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,了解しました
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.73,0:06:09.27,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,どうする
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.96,0:06:11.23,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,非常用エアロックを使う
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.03,0:06:56.33,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,皆　どこ行ったんだ
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.15,0:06:57.81,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,アナライザー
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.54,0:07:05.02,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,慣性制御システムは生きているみたいだな
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.43,0:07:28.33,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,航路変更　認証しました
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.94,0:07:30.33,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,駄目だ　アクセスできない
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.16,0:07:33.64,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,いったいどこに向かってるんだ
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.64,0:07:35.64,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.69,0:07:37.93,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,でも　船が動いているという事は
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.30,0:07:40.27,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,航法管制システムは無事な証拠
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.93,0:07:43.77,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,直接アクセス出来るのは中央電算室と
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.66,0:07:46.84,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,自動航法室
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.61,0:07:51.14,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,この状況は普通じゃない
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.58,0:07:54.91,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,なにかが起こってる　この船に
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.79,0:07:58.95,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,だが一体何が
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.54,0:08:03.11,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,おかしい　
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.83,0:08:06.76,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,電源は回復したのに　エレベーターは動いてない
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.57,0:08:09.79,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,非常階段もロックされてた　入れない
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.42,0:08:11.00,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,分かった
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.38,0:08:26.53,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,古代君　古代君
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.82,0:08:31.46,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,大丈夫
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.68,0:08:36.98,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,ごめん　なんでもない
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.52,0:08:53.69,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,ああ　ごめん
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.64,0:08:55.83,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,ああ　いや
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.50,0:09:07.54,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,中央電算室と自動航法室
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.18,0:09:09.02,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,二手に別れる
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.62,0:09:11.95,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,いや　この状況ではリスクが大きい
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.55,0:09:13.14,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,分かった
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.72,0:09:23.39,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,ガル
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.62,0:09:24.21,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,ジー
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.55,0:09:25.12,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,ネル
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.47,0:09:26.02,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,ベオ
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.55,0:09:26.98,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,アル
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.57,0:09:28.06,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,ゼオ
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.02,0:09:29.51,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,森君
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.18,0:09:31.57,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,森っ
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.88,0:09:35.60,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,森君
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.60,0:09:37.60,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.60,0:09:39.60,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.37,0:09:51.97,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,もしもし
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.29,0:09:54.53,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,進　あんた今どこにいるの
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.56,0:09:56.83,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,皆心配してたのよ
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.30,0:09:58.57,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,いい加減に戻ってらっしゃい
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.57,0:10:02.30,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,母さん
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.30,0:10:04.30,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.30,0:10:06.30,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.98,0:10:25.34,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,守からじゃないか
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.09,0:10:28.50,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,守ちゃん　もう地球に戻ってるんでしょう
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.76,0:10:29.70,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,きっとそうよ
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.69,0:10:32.56,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,今日は古代家が勢ぞろいだな
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.92,0:10:35.33,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,父さん　母さん　
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.31,0:10:37.59,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,それにおじさんたちまで
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.97,0:10:40.00,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,そんなはずは
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.24,0:10:42.42,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,父さんたちはあの日
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.41,0:10:46.07,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,久しぶりね　進さん
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.21,0:10:49.99,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,どうしたの　電話でないの
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.85,0:10:55.44,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,もしもし
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.33,0:10:57.45,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,その声は進か
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.58,0:10:59.18,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,兄さん
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.91,0:11:02.18,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,後二十分ほどでそっちに着く
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.69,0:11:06.84,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,待たせてすまないな
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.57,0:11:13.02,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,兄さん　どうして死んじまったの
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.03,0:11:15.38,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,お前の方はどうなんだ
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.76,0:11:17.71,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,ちゃんと生きてるか
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.17,0:11:18.61,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,うん
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.31,0:11:22.27,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,一体　お前は何をやってるんだ
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.34,0:11:24.66,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,僕は「ヤマト」で
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.21,0:11:27.09,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,お前のいるべき場所はそこじゃない
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.00,0:11:29.03,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,帰ってこい　進
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.78,0:11:32.52,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,お前は戦ったりする人間じゃなかったはずだ
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.03,0:11:36.71,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,お兄様の言う通り
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.36,0:11:42.24,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,一緒に帰りましょう　進さん
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.12,0:11:45.15,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,いや　僕は戻らなきゃ
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.11,0:11:47.83,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,戻る　どこに
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.92,0:11:49.61,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,「ヤマト」に
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.02,0:11:51.96,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,「ヤマト」　なんのために
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.20,0:11:54.08,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,戦うために
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.64,0:11:56.90,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,戦う　誰と
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.35,0:11:59.27,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,誰とって　決まってるじゃないか
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.15,0:12:01.78,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,えっと
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.17,0:12:06.95,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,僕は誰と
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.92,0:12:23.91,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,これが地球だ
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.70,0:12:27.03,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,土方のおじさま
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.75,0:12:30.31,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,二十世紀の家庭では
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.69,0:12:35.04,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,このような食卓で家族が揃って食事を取るのが一般的でした
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.04,0:12:36.73,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,古代君
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.39,0:12:41.03,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,君にはここで地球について学んでもらい
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.26,0:12:42.90,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,地球人として暮らしてもらう
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.72,0:12:45.00,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,パートナーを紹介しよう
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.84,0:12:46.44,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,彼女だ
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.40,0:12:49.61,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,こんにちは　　
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.07,0:12:51.41,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,初めまして
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.79,0:13:06.50,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,気が付いた
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.89,0:13:08.56,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,ここは
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.21,0:13:10.36,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,中央大病院よ
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.20,0:13:13.56,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,駄目よ　まだ動いちゃ
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.52,0:13:14.66,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_BackG JP,NTP,0,0,0,,ニュースをお伝いします
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.83,0:13:16.76,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,私　一体どうして
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.81,0:13:18.62,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,思い出せない
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.46,0:13:21.07,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,頭を強く打ったから
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.45,0:13:23.34,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,多分記憶障害を起こしているのよ
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.05,0:13:21.58,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_BackG JP,NTP,0,0,0,,爆発事故がありました
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.57,0:13:26.82,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_BackG JP,NTP,0,0,0,,この事故に巻き込まれた森雪さんは病院に搬送されましたが　
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.18,0:13:29.52,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_BackG JP,NTP,0,0,0,,現在意識不明の重体です
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.40,0:13:33.15,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_BackG JP,NTP,0,0,0,,今回　テロの可能性もあり
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.49,0:13:36.59,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_BackG JP,NTP,0,0,0,,警察では事件　事故　両面に捜査を
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.15,0:14:09.85,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,空襲警報が発令されました
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.37,0:14:11.21,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,空襲警報が
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.27,0:14:44.82,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,兄さん
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.78,0:14:46.31,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,進　
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.04,0:14:48.20,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,男ならもう泣くな
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.00,0:14:50.46,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,うん
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.07,0:14:54.68,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,昔父さんにもらった物だ
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.45,0:15:00.01,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,これは　お前が持っていろ
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.36,0:15:07.13,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,それは　貴方が持っていて
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.21,0:15:12.23,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,バカな　そんな
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.88,0:15:15.07,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,なぜお前がここに
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.70,0:15:18.43,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,大丈夫よ　雪
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.43,0:15:20.43,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.16,0:15:22.67,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,雪
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.48,0:15:27.42,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,岬さん
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.23,0:15:30.17,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,岬　あっての
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.79,0:15:34.05,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,この船は動いてる
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.09,0:15:36.64,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,波動エンジンがついている
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.54,0:15:38.47,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,なに言ってるの
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.27,0:15:40.32,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,他の皆はどこ
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.84,0:15:42.81,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,目覚めたら　ここに立っていた
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.56,0:15:44.13,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,そう
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.62,0:15:48.31,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,これは
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.44,0:15:53.36,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,遊星爆弾
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.71,0:15:58.30,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,進　この光景を忘れるな
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.69,0:16:10.80,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,駄目　ここも航路情報がロックされてる
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.83,0:16:13.56,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,いったいどこへワープしようとしてるの
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.80,0:16:16.73,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,その先に彼らは待っている
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.57,0:16:19.04,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,この船は拿捕される
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.57,0:16:21.91,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,この船には波動エンジンが付いている
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.56,0:16:24.87,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,ならば波動コアを抜けば停止する
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.76,0:16:29.27,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,貴方はここでじっとしていて
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.27,0:16:31.27,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.68,0:16:35.67,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,波動エンジン
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.84,0:16:39.20,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,ああ　お姉さまが来たんだ
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.15,0:16:43.61,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_BackG JP,NTP,0,0,0,,ワープ開始まで後120秒です
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.35,0:16:49.43,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_BackG JP,NTP,0,0,0,,ワープ開始まで後30秒です
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.21,0:16:54.97,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,母さん　次郎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.75,0:16:57.06,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,遠慮のない人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.99,0:16:59.05,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_BackG JP,NTP,0,0,0,,ワープ開始まで後10秒　9　8
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.77,0:17:05.44,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_BackG JP,NTP,0,0,0,,7　6　5　4　3　2
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.66,0:17:08.81,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,森船務長のアクセス権限を承認
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.81,0:17:10.81,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.81,0:17:12.81,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.77,0:17:13.89,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,波動コアシステム　プライマリー接続の遮断プロセスを実行します
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.61,0:17:18.96,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,量子フライホイールは　多元運動量に保存を完了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.96,0:17:20.96,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.36,0:17:21.62,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,パワーキャパシターの充電状況　良好
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.04,0:17:25.07,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,全ての位相でパワーバスの接続は解かれました
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.07,0:17:27.07,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.40,0:17:36.48,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,コアコンジットベイ内に波動防壁を展開します
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.57,0:17:40.86,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,波動防壁の展開を確認しました
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.32,0:17:44.99,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,波動コアは安全に取り出す事が出来ます
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.28,0:17:54.23,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,雪　なんて事をしてる
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.56,0:17:57.85,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,さあ　速くそれを元に戻すんだ
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.72,0:17:59.99,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,でも　これは
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.37,0:18:02.62,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,命令よ　元に戻しなさい
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.55,0:18:03.95,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,でも
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.40,0:18:07.69,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,そうしないと　地球は滅んでしまうのよ
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.34,0:18:10.41,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,滅ぶ　地球が
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.30,0:18:11.80,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,そう
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.71,0:18:14.59,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,大切な故郷が
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.50,0:18:19.04,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,故…郷
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.55,0:18:21.26,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,そう　故郷よ
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.37,0:18:25.81,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,さあ　こっちよ
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.81,0:18:27.81,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.81,0:18:29.81,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.30,0:18:31.92,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,守の奴　遅いな
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.34,0:18:33.76,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,船が遅れてるのかしら
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.26,0:18:36.55,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,あの日　僕はここにいなかった
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.57,0:18:39.41,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,宇宙港へ兄さんを迎えに行って
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.99,0:18:40.65,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,そうしたら
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.09,0:18:41.62,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,おい
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.73,0:18:42.49,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,なにあれ
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.21,0:18:44.72,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,あれが僕の町に
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.08,0:18:46.44,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,馬鹿な事を言うんじゃない
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.15,0:18:48.72,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,地球は平和よ
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.36,0:18:51.01,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,戦争なんて起こっていない
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.02,0:18:53.24,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,戦争はあるよ
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.33,0:18:55.53,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,敵はガミラスだ
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.14,0:18:58.83,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,そしてここに遊星爆弾が落ちて
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.33,0:19:01.96,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,皆　死んじまったんだ
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.33,0:19:12.29,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,そうよ　いい子ね
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.11,0:19:14.49,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,それを元に戻して
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.26,0:19:16.91,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,森君
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.91,0:19:18.91,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.38,0:19:20.21,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,雪
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.68,0:19:36.49,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,痛いじゃない
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.31,0:19:46.63,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,ゲシュタム フィールド
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.11,0:19:49.72,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,コンジットベイの波動防壁を解除します
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.37,0:19:52.99,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,速やかに退室してください
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.51,0:19:57.41,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,波動エンジンを再起動します
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.75,0:20:32.86,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,ゴーストリンク中絶
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.64,0:20:35.92,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,リンケ特務官の精神　戻りません
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.34,0:20:38.18,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,送られた情報の保存終了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.12,0:20:46.16,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,これで私は独りぼっち
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.59,0:20:53.40,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,あの遺跡はゲートを作った種族が残していたもの
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.25,0:20:56.75,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,彼女はその末裔だという噂もある
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.85,0:21:00.02,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,結局何しにいらしたのでしょう
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.67,0:21:01.83,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,魔女のする事だ
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.24,0:21:03.86,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,凡人には分かるまいな
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.37,0:21:06.22,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,何凡人だ
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.57,0:21:12.59,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,目障りな狼もこずるい女狐も今は「ヤマト」に夢中か
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.77,0:21:13.31,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,はい
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.93,0:21:16.48,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,頃合いであるな
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.19,0:21:18.47,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,なんの話で
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.06,0:21:21.64,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,貴公は知らずともよいや
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.54,0:21:30.05,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,佐渡先生の話だと
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.45,0:21:33.93,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,皆　自分が一番大切にしている思い出を見ていたみたい
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.10,0:21:37.38,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,僕は父さんや母さんと会ったよ
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.34,0:21:38.90,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,それから
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.36,0:21:43.72,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,君はどんな思い出を
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.36,0:21:45.57,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,あっ　ごめん
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.96,0:21:47.67,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,私は
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.20,0:21:51.85,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,私も会えたよ　大切な人と
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.55,0:21:57.40,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,最後に来てくれたでしょう　古代君
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.86,0:21:59.57,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,えっ　えっと
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.24,0:22:03.48,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,ちょっ　ちょっと　森君
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.26,0:22:05.64,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,今の　どういう意味
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.12,0:22:06.88,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,内緒
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.62,0:22:12.39,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,さようなら　私
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.38,0:22:15.04,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,こんにちは　貴方
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.00,0:22:17.23,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,貴方は岬
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.66,0:22:19.84,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,岬百合亜
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.19,0:25:01.35,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,見渡すは広大なる銀河間空間
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.84,0:25:05.18,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,そこに張られるは周到なる敵の罠
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.64,0:25:07.02,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,その包囲網
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.58,0:25:10.70,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,進むも地獄　引くも地獄
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.10,0:25:13.56,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,振り返る事　もはや叶わず
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.57,0:25:17.27,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,「ヤマト」よ　死中に活を見出せ
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.35,0:25:20.74,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,次回　「帰還限界点」
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.40,0:25:25.95,A-OTF Ryumin Pro EH-KL_TEXT JP,NTP,0,0,0,,人類滅亡まで　あと298日
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
